# the commit that actually changed a line rather than a whitespace/format sweep.
#
# Enable locally once:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub honors this file automatically in its blame view.
#
# Add one full 40-char commit SHA per line, with a comment describing the sweep. Example:
#   # Apply repo-wide dotnet format
#   0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
